                        "entry_id": "88690b31-2889-3451-adf1-d25188e7ef4f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Working wonders; wonderful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "06ac04b2-4181-4c4f-b089-cf70f605a781",
                                "sense_id": "02f068c8-15e5-3216-b9f7-c513aa178718",
                                "text": "1681, Arthur Bury, The Constant Communicant, Oxford: Stephen Botton, Part 4, Chapter 1, p. 192,\nThe Spirit of Grace, in whose mirific power our Savior first, and his Apostls afterward, proclaimed the Gospel […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a3a0bd5-9395-421a-884e-39d6472ede64",
                                "sense_id": "02f068c8-15e5-3216-b9f7-c513aa178718",
                                "text": "See the very intelligible Theorist is at hand in our Necessity, to teach the impetuous Motions of mirifick Exultation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dce93d55-1162-4d6a-81a2-9c5f46b27610",
                                "sense_id": "02f068c8-15e5-3216-b9f7-c513aa178718",
                                "text": "[…] there is the Doctor, whom Mrs. P. does not condescend to visit: that man educates a mirific family, and is loved by the poor for miles round;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb58fd78-bc36-4945-9ca1-3f0344db7dcd",
                                "sense_id": "02f068c8-15e5-3216-b9f7-c513aa178718",
                                "text": "a carpet overgrown with huge, gorgeous flowers, and the walls overgrown with huge, gorgeous flowers of another but equally mirific plant"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdffd3f6-02c0-46f7-a006-916cf04c5abe",
                                "sense_id": "02f068c8-15e5-3216-b9f7-c513aa178718",
                                "text": "In as blasé a tone as I could manage in such mirific circumstances, I murmured, “Ma’am, if you would care to glance out of the window—over there—you will see a flying saucer.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
